ece bath complete the main floor. Downstairs offers a spacious recreation room with a wood-burning fireplace, a 4th bedroom and a 3-piece bath. Enjoy central A/C, a fenced backyard, back-lane access and a double detached garage. Steps from Ottewell Park, schools, playgrounds and the community league, with shopping and transit nearby. A wonderful opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or renovators to make this home their own! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$409,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,230 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,430 sq ft"],["Year built","1961"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Ottewell"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6B0W5"],["MLS® number","E4514012"],["Listed","October 23, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Stove, Dryer, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Fireplace","Wood"],["Basement","Partially finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","6.07 m × 3.47 m (19'11\" × 11'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.23 m × 2.50 m (10'7\" × 8'2\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.69 m × 2.71 m (15'5\" × 8'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.15 m × 3.47 m (13'7\" × 11'5\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.54 m × 2.93 m (11'7\" × 9'7\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.05 m × 2.87 m (10'0\" × 9'5\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.87 m × 2.99 m (12'8\" × 9'10\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","5.15 m × 4.66 m (16'11\" × 15'3\")"]],"courtesy":"Catherine Hunt, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"ottewell","area":"southeast-edmonton"}